        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">For a full home set, buy REP Fitness's 5 to 50 lb rubber hex set with
            its three-tier rack</strong> if the budget allows, or CAP's 550 lb rubber hex set with
            two-tier rack for the same range at far less per pound. Start with CAP's 150 lb or 100 lb set
